text: ['Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Flying', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', "You may have Rhox assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.\\n{2}{G}: Regenerate Rhox. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)"]
flavor: ['". . . Before honor is humility."\\n—*The Bible*, Proverbs 15:33', '"And the unclean spirits went out, and entered the swine: and the herd ran violently . . . ."\\n—*The Bible*, Mark 5:13', '"I am that merry wanderer of the night."\\n—William Shakespeare,\\n*A Midsummer Night\'s Dream*', 'All orggs know how to kill; training teaches them *what* to kill.', 'Assault and battery included.', "At the sight of the thing the calamari vendor's eyes went wide, but from fear or avarice none could tell.", 'Hunter by instinct, weapon by training.', 'Its swamp cousin may be meaner, but the vizzerdrix is much bigger.', "Just because they have a club doesn't mean they're organized.", 'Like the tide, time both ebbs and flows.', 'Meant to cut through the body and burn straight to the soul.', 'Only the warrior who can admit mortal weakness will be bolstered by immortal strength.', 'The enthusiasm of the young, sharpened by the discipline of a soldier.', 'The forest lives in the elf as the elf lives in the forest.', "The nightstalkers' little game of tease-the-squirrel suddenly took an unexpected turn.", 'The touch of death is never gentle.', 'Two little goblins, out in the sun. Down came a griffin, and then there was one.', 'Where air meets water, fish meets talon.']
